@startuml
' Pakkediagram (PD) – Vekto WPF Application, logisk arkitektur
' Samme format som undervisningens eksempel (Pr23 «Opbygning af pakkediagram»):
'  - Tre pakker side om side: UI, Application, Domain.
'  - Underpakker pr. use case i Application og pr. domæneområde i Domain.
'  - Kun klassenavne. Stiplede, lige pile med «uses» fra den, der bruger, mod den, der bliver brugt.
'  - Umærkede pile mellem pakkerne viser afhængigheden mellem lagene.
' Lagene svarer til MVVM (Pr27/Pr29) og namespaces i koden:
'  UI = View (Vekto.Views), Application = ViewModel (Vekto.ViewModels), Domain = Model (Vekto.Models).
'  Repositories ligger i Vekto.Models i koden (som PersonRepository i Pr27) og står derfor i Domain.
' Ingen database/CSV som nederste lag (Larman kap. 13).

left to right direction
skinparam linetype polyline
skinparam packageStyle folder
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam ranksep 110
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam package {
  BorderColor black
  BackgroundColor white
  FontStyle plain
  FontSize 12
}
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor white
  BorderColor black
  ArrowColor black
}
skinparam ArrowColor black
hide circle
hide members
hide stereotype

' =====================================================================
package "UI" as UI {
  class MainWindow
  class CreateEmployee
  class CreateCostumer
  class CreateService
  class CreateReceipt
}

' =====================================================================
package "Application" as Application {
  package "UC1 Opret medarbejder" as UC1 {
    class CreateEmployeeController
  }
  package "UC2 Opret kunde" as UC2 {
    class CreateCostumerController
  }
  package "UC3 Opret service" as UC3 {
    class CreateServiceController
  }
  package "UC4 Service kvittering" as UC4 {
    class CreateReceiptController
  }
  class MainViewModel
}

' =====================================================================
package "Domain" as Domain {
  package "Employee-related" as EmpRel {
    class EmployeeRepository
    class Employee
  }
  package "Costumer-related" as CosRel {
    class CostumerRepository
    class Costumer
  }
  package "Service-related" as SerRel {
    class ServiceRepository
    class Service
    enum ServiceStatus
  }
}

' ---------- Skjulte hjælpelinjer: holder rækkerne på linje ----------
CreateEmployee -[hidden]right- CreateCostumer
CreateCostumer -[hidden]right- CreateService
CreateService -[hidden]right- CreateReceipt
CreateEmployeeController -[hidden]right- CreateCostumerController
CreateCostumerController -[hidden]right- CreateServiceController
CreateServiceController -[hidden]right- CreateReceiptController
CreateReceiptController -[hidden]right- MainViewModel
EmployeeRepository -[hidden]right- CostumerRepository
CostumerRepository -[hidden]right- ServiceRepository

' ---------- Afhængigheder mellem lagene ----------
UI ..> Application
Application ..> Domain

' ---------- UI ----------
MainWindow ..> CreateEmployee : <<uses>>
MainWindow ..> CreateCostumer : <<uses>>
MainWindow ..> CreateService : <<uses>>
CreateService ..> CreateReceipt : <<uses>>

' ---------- UI -> Application ----------
CreateEmployee ..> CreateEmployeeController : <<uses>>
CreateCostumer ..> CreateCostumerController : <<uses>>
CreateService ..> CreateServiceController : <<uses>>
CreateReceipt ..> CreateReceiptController : <<uses>>

' ---------- Application -> Domain ----------
CreateEmployeeController ..> EmployeeRepository : <<uses>>
CreateCostumerController ..> CostumerRepository : <<uses>>
CreateServiceController ..> CostumerRepository : <<uses>>
CreateServiceController ..> ServiceRepository : <<uses>>
CreateReceiptController ..> ServiceRepository : <<uses>>

' ---------- Domain ----------
EmployeeRepository ..> Employee : <<uses>>
CostumerRepository ..> Costumer : <<uses>>
ServiceRepository ..> Service : <<uses>>
Service ..> ServiceStatus : <<uses>>
@enduml
